  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-25T01:02:06-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, April 25, 2018, 1:02 am\">April 25, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p><img src=\"/media/archive/6a2b925c807a1d4796a9f291d23384afdf1704c8dc20f9f42afe86caa8827baa.jpg\" class=\"wp-image-3725 size-full\" height=\"2048\" alt=\"Photo Credit G. Tom Wilson\" width=\"1536\" loading=\"lazy\" />Sharon and Paul Hammersten will be attending the Crazy Horse Memorial Foundation Private Insider’s Event in Boston/Marlborough, MA on Saturday, May 5th.</p>\n<p>Sharon and Paul are longstanding members of The Guild of Harwich Artists. Paul has been a participating member of The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists for many years and Sharon is the gallery secretary and keeper of the files.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/archive/4258d87b111fb7ad53328fcbdbb217d70b40f45963d73c65922887b00d8a7df0.jpg\" class=\"wp-image-3734 size-full\" height=\"874\" width=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" />Paul’s masterwork, THE CHEYENNE, hangs in The Museum of the American Indian at the Crazy Horse Memorial in South Dakota and may be viewed on his Guild Artist’s Profile.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/archive/4eb263ed6631e879a24a2a32898c58ff4bf1160fd0a7b98325ca13fa3a6db570.jpg\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3735\" height=\"296\" width=\"395\" loading=\"lazy\" />Fine art cards of THE CHEYENNE are available for free at The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists, 551Route 28, Harwich Port.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/archive/4d971f297135bdec32c7e8287a89debf1844f65bdf34dc77675e2ded79a370cf.jpg\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3736\" height=\"720\" width=\"960\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/archive/b3b9fe1fdefd86ec9ce28f71245eafb0550312bcb22f1c53e01ab789d7f75661.jpg\" class=\"wp-image-3737 size-full\" height=\"1152\" width=\"2048\" /></p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-3b7a7197884c65093e45/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-bc2e4bef39a39f9eb9e9/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY ARTISTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t<br /><span class=\"entry-terms post_tag\">Tagged <a href=\"/archive/source-4339d740c4572ed23d26/\" rel=\"tag\">Crazy Horse Memorial Foundation</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-b83dbef39d7b1fbd2ecc/\" rel=\"tag\">Paul Hammersten</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-b9ab081a4bc798f19819/\" rel=\"tag\">The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists</a></span>\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
